-- Classic 1.60 (vanilla): players have a base health per class and level, stamina adds on top (first 20 points 1 health each,
-- then 10). Retail has no base health, so a level 10 hunter had about 90 health instead of about 200. Values: VMaNGOS 1.12
-- player_classlevelstats.basehp. Safe to run again.
